Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.66,1:31:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ I Love You ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.56,1:32:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 爸爸 妈妈 爷爷 奶奶 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.40,1:32:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 漂亮的大姊姊 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.16,1:32:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我爱你们 ∮
